    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sultan is very fond of precious stones, he adores and collects them, but his time is limited for collecting stones, but driven by passion and greed, he will never stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magatch</strong> is a 3-D game where the player needs to collect interconnected stones of the same color in order to accumulate a certain number of points, but with a limited number of attempts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse Button - Taking Stones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 in a row</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complexity</p></li></ul>",
